{"2546650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breach Signal", "steam_appid": 2546650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Events &amp; announcements</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >O5 Interactive will be present at AG French Direct on <strong>May 27th</strong> to showcase Breach Signal. <br>We will unveil the game's new trailer for the occasion.<br><br><i>Stay tuned!</i> <br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/95fc0038ceda30f2f97f215ce84a3cde.avif?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=346 /></span></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/0a80b553b158edb01449ea02b037f738.avif?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/34036026708da2c81cea7943b54c40b8.poster.avif?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/34036026708da2c81cea7943b54c40b8.webm?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/34036026708da2c81cea7943b54c40b8.mp4?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breach Signal is a 1–6 player online co-op cosmic horror game. You’ve been recruited into the [REDACTED] program, an initiative led by the para-governmental <strong>Federal Normality Agency</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission</strong>: investigate <strong>dimensional breaches</strong>, unstable phenomena that distort reality and open passages to the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead scientific expeditions</strong>: identify <strong>Anchor Objects</strong>, retrieve samples for the Agency, and confront the <span class=\"bb_strike\">un</span>explainable.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with a <strong>cutting-edge technology case </strong>and investigation tools, you operate within a retrofuturistic 80s world soaked in <strong>cosmic horror</strong> and bureaucratic secrecy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/fa4016b45e02691eec73755281aeab6f.poster.avif?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/fa4016b45e02691eec73755281aeab6f.webm?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/fa4016b45e02691eec73755281aeab6f.mp4?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/b3d0821d4bcccc7e6f680770fb587fdb.webp?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >/!\\ Once inside the Domes, all contact with the outside is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-Open Map</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a stylized, semi-open environment where you can get truly lost… <span class=\"bb_strike\">for your own pleasure!</span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Investigations</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition is different: randomized spawn points, evolving objectives and dynamic threats ensure no session feels the same.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analog Tech &amp; Tools</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use unique, retro-futuristic investigation devices such as signal tracker, sampler, scanners and more, to detect anomalous entities and objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/ff745a8007d23bbb2e881a7227a852f1.poster.avif?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/ff745a8007d23bbb2e881a7227a852f1.webm?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/ff745a8007d23bbb2e881a7227a852f1.mp4?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/e8f80a44083da478ec4755198588daf4.webp?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay close to your team... What lies beyond remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team-Based Survival</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with 1–6 players in an expedition where communication is essential. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use proximity voice chat to communicate with other recruits, or your Talkie to communicate from a greater range. But be careful, you may not be the only one listening... </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Efficient Deployment</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic team planning ensures maximum sample recovery! With more credits, better gear follows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it back with samples... and <i>some</i> memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/cee2c4c1919c39bd4f55c9648f68007f.poster.avif?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/cee2c4c1919c39bd4f55c9648f68007f.webm?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/cee2c4c1919c39bd4f55c9648f68007f.mp4?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/0a80b553b158edb01449ea02b037f738.avif?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/34036026708da2c81cea7943b54c40b8.poster.avif?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/34036026708da2c81cea7943b54c40b8.webm?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/34036026708da2c81cea7943b54c40b8.mp4?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/