e the Domes, all contact with the outside is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-Open Map</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a stylized, semi-open environment where you can get truly lost… <span class=\"bb_strike\">for your own pleasure!</span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Investigations</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition is different: randomized spawn points, evolving objectives and dynamic threats ensure no session feels the same.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analog Tech &amp; Tools</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use unique, retro-futuristic investigation devices such as signal tracker, sampler, scanners and more, to detect anomalous entities and objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/ff745a8007d23bbb2e881a7227a852f1.poster.avif?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/ff745a8007d23bbb2e881a7227a852f1.webm?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/ff745a8007d23bbb2e881a7227a852f1.mp4?t=1784581285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/e8f80a44083da478ec4755198588daf4.webp?t=1784581285\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay close to your team... What lies beyond remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p clas